{
  "_comment": "Hand-computed expectations for PlanList (BACKLOG MEAL-003). Shared with Android. Ingredients merge on their GTIN, or on their folded words when typed (case, accents, punctuation and spacing ignored), in the order they first appear. Each counts quantity x planned servings / the meal's servings packs; a line's amounts are added as exact fractions and rounded up once. Meals planned for 0 servings add nothing. A line is in the pantry when any of its ingredients is.",
